  "ModVersion": "1.3.0",
  "ModDescription": "**Shares the three potion slots.** When all six loot squares are full, a seventh loot item picked from a loot table goes into a free potion square instead of being silently discarded — up to three extra items (loot items 7-9). Loot still fills the six loot squares first.\n\n**Potions survive area transitions.** The game's potion wipe at a stage transition is cancelled, so potions — and any loot sharing their slots — carry into the next area.\n\nStore purchases are left untouched. The Toybox still stops at six loot / three potions. Online play is not limited: every player in a lobby must install the same mod version.",
